ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1WZlRjToJFkQ7kNvwGDAFtg&_nc_oc=AdrDlaAm0uI_H31DOi4RsuKk4IVl02VsIEeOvHvMy0KaNmV-eUiq4s728U7q3-HTGzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLFYOiaT6gjHKpeyVvWJ2lmOPZQdvcvYn07DndA4ETJCA&oe=6AA2CAFC"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=76EQdZOMwkoQ7kNvwG40cen&_nc_oc=AdrGE0IDC3g-UBM5UxUvtepYMMAH_kcjHLa0MpuTcW0Phby0qKjpk93_Jig_zWkou7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ3GFNF1lL9kXhtR751uUENO8-PKC3_MpLzC4t8nZ-Uug&oe=6AA2AF16"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ofqCrn5NergQ7kNvwGh80SG&_nc_oc=AdqsqqLEpqN891qEuh5r-piPek-G4AvW4sUD5pHHqbp9ptZ0NOmzBfQHPrWU4qW0hM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLzK6TFKsKfrlGBF-bhZ1WGRGB0ySSynqd_jI4w-hZqeg&oe=6AA2BCE4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_